*/src/generated/** linguist-generated

# Vendored VMX-pi SDK headers are copied verbatim from the vendor under MIT,
# and hal/tools/verify_vmx_crosscompile.py checks their SHA-256 digests. They
# carry upstream trailing whitespace that must not be rewritten, so exempt
# them from whitespace checking rather than editing third-party content.
thirdparty/vmxpi/include/*.h -whitespace
